{"chunk_id": "a25eff76cbc1", "text": "Arjuna dazzles the gathered court with an extraordinary weapons exhibition, conjuring elemental forces\u2014fire, water, wind, clouds, land, and mountains\u2014and then making them vanish, while also demonstrating near-impossible feats of archery and martial dexterity. Just as the spectacle ends, a thunderous newcomer enters: Karna, radiant with natural armor and earrings, and immediately challenges Arjuna\u2019s supremacy. The crowd is captivated as Karna replicates Arjuna\u2019s feats, winning Duryodhana\u2019s enthusiastic support and friendship. Tension erupts into open rivalry when Arjuna denounces Karna as an intruder, and Karna replies that true Kshatriyas prove themselves by might alone. As the two prepare to duel, cosmic imagery mirrors the conflict\u2014Indra favoring Arjuna and the Sun shining upon Karna\u2014while the assembly divides and Kunti faints, knowing the two warriors are unknowingly brothers.\nArjuna dazzles the arena with weapon feats until Karna enters, matches them, and challenges him, igniting rivalry while Kunti secretly recognizes her firstborn.\nThemes: heroic rivalry, public martial display, hidden lineage, friendship and allegiance, divine parentage", "vector": [0.0003017087292391807, -0.013196074403822422, 0.0031458500307053328, 0.00871210265904665, 0.0011420327937230468, 0.02477630414068699, -0.026136307045817375, -0.014354097656905651, -0.04112327843904495, -0.03808009997010231, -0.0005870065069757402, 0.005190904717892408, 0.002240302972495556, 0.006460017058998346, -0.0037804062012583017, 0.004894666373729706, 0.046186260879039764, -0.00886695459485054, 0.021948574110865593, -0.030808795243501663, -0.014650336466729641, 0.001476142555475235, -0.011418644338846207, 0.02357788383960724, -0.02391451969742775, 0.02682304196059704, 0.018393712118268013, -0.03867257758975029, 0.01094735600054264, -0.010644384659826756, -0.005675658583641052, -0.0003610405547078699, 0.0050798156298696995, -0.01353944